{
  "id": "alg8-c4-s2-n26",
  "card_id": "alg8-c4-s2-n26",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "26",
  "title": "$n$ 次算术根的性质",
  "printed_title": "26. $n$ 次算术根的性质",
  "start_page": 159,
  "start_printed": 152,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 20,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们知道算术平方根具有下列性质：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b>0$，那么 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$n$ 次算术根（当 $n>2$ 时）具有类似的性质。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理 $1$ **如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$。**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理 $2$ **如果 $a\\geqslant0$，$b>0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt[n]{a}}{\\sqrt[n]{b}}$。**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来证明定理 $1$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式 $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$ 的值是非负数，因为当 $a\\geqslant0$ 和 $b\\geqslant0$ 时，其中每一个式子都有意义并且取非负值。此外，积 $\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$的 $n$ 次幂等于 $ab$，就是：$(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=(\\sqrt[n]{a})^n\\cdot(\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=ab$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#14",
        "p0160#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$ $(a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0)$ 是真等式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，两个非负因数的积的 $n$ 次算术根等于这两个因数的 $n$ 次算术根的积。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "通过类似的讨论，可以证明 $n$ 次算术根的第二个性质（定理 $2$）：当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，分子是非负数而分母是正数的分数的 $n$ 次算术根等于分子的 $n$ 次算术根除以分母的 $n$ 次算术根。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们举出应用这两个定理的例子。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 $1$ 求式 $\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}$ 的值。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据定理 $1$ 得：$\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}=\\sqrt[4]{16}\\times\\sqrt[4]{81}=2\\times3=6$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 $2$ 化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们写出等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$（$a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0$），或写成另一形式：$\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}=\\sqrt[n]{ab}$。利用这个等式，得到：$\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}=\\sqrt[3]{2\\times4}=\\sqrt[3]{8}=2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 $3$ 求式 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}$ 的值。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据定理 $2$，得$\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{64}{27}}=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{64}}{\\sqrt[3]{27}}=\\frac{4}{3}=1\\frac{1}{3}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在，我们讨论 $n$ 次算术根的其他性质。我们从例子着手。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "假设需要比较根式 $\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{64}$ 的值的大小，$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt{4}=2$，　　$\\sqrt[6]{64}=\\sqrt[6]{2^6}=2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们看到，这两个式子的值相等，也就是，$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt[6]{64}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 153,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0160#14",
        "p0161#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理 $3$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$n$ 和 $k$ 是自然数）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的值是非负的，此外，式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的 $nk$ 次幂等于 $a$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上：$(\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^{nk}=((\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^n)^k=(\\sqrt[k]{a})^k=a$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$a\\geqslant0$）是真等式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理 $4$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$（$n$、$k$ 和 $m$ 是自然数）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据定理 $3$ 得到：$\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a^{mk}}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{(a^m)^k}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们已经证明，如果根指数和被开方式的幂指数同乘以或者同除以同一个自然数，那么根式的值不变。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "有时，我们把根式的这个性质叫做根式的基本性质（和分式的基本性质类似）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们举一个应用定理 $3$ 和定理 $4$ 的例子。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把因数 $2$ 移到平方根号下面，得到：$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^2\\times2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据定理 $3$，得：$\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}=\\sqrt[6]{2_3}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用定理 $4$，得：$\\sqrt[6]{2^3}=\\sqrt{2}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt{2}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 154,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#15"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
